                <pb facs="1232" n="1222" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1222"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.0093/1–3049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in the
                        Philippines</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lockett</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-01-31T20:00:00-05:00">January 31, 1949—8
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>116. Re Nanking’s 275, Jan 30 to Dept, rptd Manila 15. No action should be taken
                    re return evacuated dependents to China pending receipt Dept’s further
                    instructions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
